      "text": "Cardiovascular (CV) pharmacology targets the heart, vasculature, kidneys, and the hormonal systems that regulate them. Understanding CV drugs requires a working model of cardiac physiology: preload, afterload, contractility, and the renin-angiotensin-aldosterone system (RAAS)."
